description:
Provide Stevedoring and Related Terminal Services (S&RTS) handling the import and export of designated USG cargo through the Ports of Ashdod and Haifa, Israel. The contractor shall complete all tasks as outlined in the Performance Work Statement (PWS) and in a manner consistent with the &ldquo;Best Commercial Practices.&rdquo;

 S&RTS services will cover the full spectrum of managing USG cargo transiting through the specified ports in this contract. Operational tasks shall include but are not limited to all stevedoring and longshoring required for vessel, truck, port reception and disposition, cargo management staging, intra port transfers, cargo prep, Checking and Tallying (C&T), and warehousing Government provided dunnage and tiedown materials.

 Requirements include physical security, facilities, storage/staging, office space, office supplies, and providing documentation/reports for port operation expenses and reconciliation of services to include other related miscellaneous requirements as outlined in this PWS.

Please see - Attachment-1-Sources Sought Notice.;

 Attachement-2-Statement of Works Modular Facility

 Attachement-3-Statement of Requirements Concrete Pad;

 If you have any questions please contact the identified government points of contact.
